Package: countme
Type: Package
Title: Count regression with covariate measurement error
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Sarah", "Lotspeich",
      email = "lotspes@wfu.edu",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Fits negative binomial regression models for count 
    outcomes (subject to possible zero inflation) with covariate 
    measurement error, using sieve maximum likelihood estimation
    based on partial validation data.
